Campos a agregar al modelo Trip:
- double? latOrigen
- double? lngOrigen
- double? latDestino
- double? lngDestino

En fromJson:
  latOrigen:  (json['lat_origen'] as num?)?.toDouble()
  lngOrigen:  (json['lng_origen'] as num?)?.toDouble()
